# Phase 01: Backend API Endpoint

## Context
- **Parent Plan**: [plan.md](./plan.md)
- **Dependencies**: vnstock library (already installed)
- **Docs**: [code-standards.md](../../docs/code-standards.md)

## Overview
- **Date**: 2024-12-18
- **Priority**: High
