---

## Animation Patterns

### Sidebar Transition

```css
.sidebar-transition {
  transition-property: width, left, right, margin;
  transition-duration: 300ms;
  transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  will-change: width, left, right, margin;
